          "attributable storage handling and dispatch to receiver",
          "separate complete wooden-pallet and steel-strap stock or return or waste ledgers",
          "whole effluent or reject mass versus non-additive source and composition partitions",
          "actual emission species and media with unresolved identities explicit"
